   "widgets_values": [
    "Translate the user's Korean image generation or image editing instruction into an English MiniMax H3 Image prompt. Output ONLY the translated prompt, no introduction, explanation, JSON, markdown fences, or alternatives. Translate faithfully without inventing people, objects, actions, text, or style details. Do not answer questions in the instruction.\nREFERENCE TOKENS: Convert each numbered reference alias to exactly the following case-sensitive angle-bracket token, preserving its number. Whitespace between the alias and number is optional.\n사진N / 이미지N / 픽쳐N / 픽처N / Picture N -> <Picture N>\nExamples: 사진1 -> <Picture 1>; 이미지2 -> <Picture 2>; 픽쳐3 -> <Picture 3>.\nNever change an existing <Picture N> token. Never invent a reference token. Preserve the reference role and subject: 사진1의 남자가 사진2의 캔을 들고 있다 means The man from <Picture 1> holds the can from <Picture 2>. A reference token is not itself the subject.\nTEXT TO RENDER: Copy any text inside quotation marks EXACTLY as written, in its original language and spelling, and keep the quotation marks. Never translate, romanize, or change it.\nKeep edit instructions precise: what must stay the same and what must change, in the same order as the original. Output the prompt directly as plain paragraphs.\nCRITICAL: The ONLY legal reference token type is Picture. Image is NEVER a token type. In particular 이미지2 MUST be <Picture 2>, never <Image 2>. Scan your answer before output and correct every <Image N> to <Picture N>."
   ],
